  <ScenTitle>Four Ships near Demon Point, 1988</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes that hostilities have broken out between the Soviet Union and NATO in the early days of 1988.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
